                <pb facs="0172" n="128" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg128"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The information set forth above is derived from the accounts of the dinner in
                    Acheson, <hi rendition="#italic">Present at the Creation</hi>, page 627 and
                    Acheson, <hi rendition="#italic">Sketches from Life</hi>, pages 111–113. No
                    official record of the discussions during the dinner have been found, and
                    presumably no substantive matters were taken up.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
